{"steam_appid":3653250,"steam_name":"Sporting Goods Shop","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3653250/200375445/11b872ce6507d2d8ef6c7125d65041292287d453/1752062457/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752067192","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257166879/07362b0aea62c4d5eaab4cb81567230cecba349e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752067192","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/b3ac0d9457a4c607c8d3d1b77b9910c3e5abf66a/ss_b3ac0d9457a4c607c8d3d1b77b9910c3e5abf66a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789128302","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/7533749ce56b1c3a4bbfc99a7d88691ad5eab622/ss_7533749ce56b1c3a4bbfc99a7d88691ad5eab622.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789128302","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/5c7710557ca2ab94bb2031ebfc189f7105fca801/ss_5c7710557ca2ab94bb2031ebfc189f7105fca801.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789128302","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/153a9fb490b2bb53e07f969c4e8d057332eee3f1/ss_153a9fb490b2bb53e07f969c4e8d057332eee3f1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789128302","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/508e21192c91ebe3a5454d53eb7d2ac8a65adfd8/ss_508e21192c91ebe3a5454d53eb7d2ac8a65adfd8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789128302"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person simulation game where you step into the role of a sporting goods shop owner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work alone or with friends to expand your humble shop into a huge sporting goods shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/extras/743b548b86b5d7843bb52dd4f8771f67.poster.avif?t=1789128302\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/extras/743b548b86b5d7843bb52dd4f8771f67.webm?t=1789128302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/extras/743b548b86b5d7843bb52dd4f8771f67.mp4?t=1789128302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op Mode and Single Player</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the duties with your friends in co-op mode (for up to 4 players).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more players in the store, the more demanding customers will visit your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also go solo and manage everything in the store. If you change your mind, you can invite your friends anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/extras/3c287b5b5332183f2e193d1b38a52d16.poster.avif?t=1789128302\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/extras/3c287b5b5332183f2e193d1b38a52d16.webm?t=1789128302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/extras/3c287b5b5332183f2e193d1b38a52d16.mp4?t=1789128302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Store Workflow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sign contracts with leading brands, order new products with an in-game computer or with your tablet while walking in the store, unpack the boxes, place the products into your store, and set the prices for your products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consider the market prices while setting up your product prices in the store for customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always keep your store clean so as not to lose any customers. Also, be careful with the thieves to avoid some box losses that would cause a leak in your finances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run some little contests and reward your customers with some gifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/extras/89256d4ba07769c7042e438ba349b5a8.poster.avif?t=1789128302\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/extras/89256d4ba07769c7042e438ba349b5a8.webm?t=1789128302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/extras/89256d4ba07769c7042e438ba349b5a8.mp4?t=1789128302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Products</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please make sure your customers find all their needs in the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always expand your product portfolio and satisfy your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sports equipment and accessories, fitness and gym products, skates, rackets, nutrition and body care products, swimming goggles, golf clubs, boxing gloves, sports clothes and shoes, and more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware of the market prices and purchase more products when they're cheap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/extras/fceb381f717fab433d8b31552e52e185.poster.avif?t=1789128302\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/extras/fceb381f717fab433d8b31552e52e185.webm?t=1789128302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/extras/fceb381f717fab433d8b31552e52e185.mp4?t=1789128302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place a sufficient number of checkouts to reduce the waiting time for customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan products and collect payments whether in cash or with card purchases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to fulfill the online orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/extras/5e3e934a8c17041ae9a3b7011be85656.poster.avif?t=1789128302\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/extras/5e3e934a8c17041ae9a3b7011be85656.webm?t=1789128302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/extras/5e3e934a8c17041ae9a3b7011be85656.mp4?t=1789128302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expansions and New Teammates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your store and warehouse by leveling up your store and budget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire stockers to fill the racks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase more cash registers and hire new cashiers to minimize long queues at the checkouts and to reduce waiting time for customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire a janitor to clean the store and hire a security guard to chase down the thieves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/extras/d5468d07ebd6b0b5c83ddd84650f0ef9.poster.avif?t=1789128302\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/extras/d5468d07ebd6b0b5c83ddd84650f0ef9.webm?t=1789128302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653250/extras/d5468d07ebd6b0b5c83ddd84650f0ef9.mp4?t=1789128302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit | Windows 8 64-bit | Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400F | AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 | AMD Radeon RX-580<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1700 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit | Windows 8 64-bit | Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-11400F | AMD Ryzen 5 5600x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 | AMD Radeon R9-290X<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1700 MB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Casual","Indie","RPG","Simulation","Sports"],"developers":["Business Tycoon"],"publishers":["Business Tycoon","Gamersky Games"],"release_date":"Sep 11, 2026"}